' QUESTION THIS DIAGRAM ANSWERS: Where do independent books and control functions observe events?
' SOURCES: [GAM] [PD1445] conceptual lanes
@startuml
title 08g Independent accounting and assurance processes
skinparam shadowing false
|#EEF4FB|Agency operations|
start
:Generate a recognized financial or physical event;
fork
  |#EDF7ED|Accounting|
  :Determine recognition and measurement;
  :Journalize and post by entity / fund / period;
  :Prepare financial reports;
fork again
  |#EEF4FB|Budget office|
  :Update budget registries and accountability reports;
fork again
  |#FFF8DC|Treasury, bank and property offices|
  :Provide independent balance and asset confirmations;
end fork
|#EDF7ED|Agency accounting and control|
:Investigate differences and document reconciliation;
fork
  |#FDF1E3|COA|
  :Examine records, transactions and compliance independently;
fork again
  |#EEF4FB|Agency internal assurance|
  :Test effectiveness of controls across processes;
end fork
|#EDF7ED|Agency management|
:Respond and remediate findings;
stop
@enduml
